# Status bar, ported from st_lib.c and st_stuff.c as one unit.
#
# The exported symbols keep the exact C names via @flow_api. The widget
# structs (st_number_t, st_percent_t, st_multicon_t, st_binicon_t) were
# private to these two files (verified by grep: no other engine file
# touches them, st_backing_screen, st_palette or the STlib_* entry
# points), so they are flattened into module-internal parallel arrays.
# Where the C widgets stored int*/boolean* pointers into player_t or into
# module statics, this port stores a small source id and resolves the
# value at draw time, which reads the same memory at the same moment.
#
# player_t fields go through PLAYER_* (user.flow) on st_plyr, bound in
# ST_initData to PLAYER_at(STAT_consoleplayer()). patch_t fields use
# PATCH_* (video.flow). cheatseq_t tables and idmypos formatting live here.

